# Hand-authored prose with intentional line wrapping — every markdown
# file at the repo root, plus everything under docs/. Prettier does not
# merely reflow these, it rewrites them: on AGENTS.md it turned a
# continuation line starting with `+` into a `-` list item, changing what
# the sentence said, and it pads every table to its widest cell, which
# defeats the hand wrapping the rest of the file depends on.
#
# Formatting is therefore enforced on code, not on prose. What
# `format:check` actually covers is `packages/*/src/**/*.{ts,json}` plus
# the root `package.json` and `pnpm-workspace.yaml`.
